    {
      "source": "All registered resolvers are wrapped in a single (composite) ViewResolver\nwith its order property set to 0 so that other external resolvers may be ordered\nbefore or after it.",
      "translation": "所有已注册的解析器都被封装在一个单一的（组合）ViewResolver 中，其 order 属性设置为 0，以便其他外部解析器可以在它之前或之后进行排序。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "When content negotiation is enabled the order property is set to highest priority\ninstead with the ContentNegotiatingViewResolver encapsulating all other registered\nview resolver instances. That way the resolvers registered through the MVC namespace\nform a self-encapsulated resolver chain.",
      "translation": "启用内容协商时，order 属性被设置为最高优先级，而 ContentNegotiatingViewResolver 封装了所有其他已注册的视图解析器实例。这样，通过 MVC 命名空间注册的解析器便形成了一个自封装的解析器链。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The bean name used for the <code>ViewResolverComposite</code>.",
      "translation": "用于<code>ViewResolverComposite</code>的 Bean 名称。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>context</code> - the object encapsulating the current state of the parsing process;\nprovides access to a <a href=\"../../../beans/factory/support/BeanDefinitionRegistry.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.support\"><code>BeanDefinitionRegistry</code></a>",
      "translation": "<code>context</code> - 封装当前解析过程状态的對象；提供对<a href=\"../../../beans/factory/support/BeanDefinitionRegistry.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.support\"><code>BeanDefinitionRegistry</code></a>的访问",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Sivaprasad Valluru, Sebastien Deleuze, Rossen Stoyanchev",
      "translation": "Sivaprasad Valluru，Sebastien Deleuze，Rossen Stoyanchev",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Implementations must return the primary <a href=\"../../../beans/factory/config/BeanDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanDefinition</code></a> that results\nfrom the parse if they will ever be used in a nested fashion (for example as\nan inner tag in a <code>&lt;property/&gt;</code> tag). Implementations may return\n<code>null</code> if they will <strong>not</strong> be used in a nested fashion.",
      "translation": "实现必须返回解析后生成的主<a href=\"../../../beans/factory/config/BeanDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanDefinition</code></a>，如果它们将来可能以嵌套方式使用（例如作为<code>&lt;property/&gt;</code>标签内的内部标签）。如果实现不会以嵌套方式使用，则可以返回<code>null</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Parse the specified <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.xml/org/w3c/dom/Element.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.w3c.dom\"><code>Element</code></a> and register the resulting\n<a href=\"../../../beans/factory/config/BeanDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanDefinition(s)</code></a> with the\n<a href=\"../../../beans/factory/xml/ParserContext.html#getRegistry()\"><code>BeanDefinitionRegistry</code></a>\nembedded in the supplied <a href=\"../../../beans/factory/xml/ParserContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans.factory.xml\"><code>ParserContext</code></a>.",
      "translation": "解析指定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.xml/org/w3c/dom/Element.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.w3c.dom\"><code>Element</code></a>，并将生成的\n<a href=\"../../../beans/factory/config/BeanDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanDefinition(s)</code></a> 注册到\n<a href=\"../../../beans/factory/xml/ParserContext.html#getRegistry()\"><code>BeanDefinitionRegistry</code></a>\n中，该 <a href=\"../../../beans/factory/xml/ParserContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans.factory.xml\"><code>ParserContext</code></a> 已嵌入其中。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"../../../beans/factory/xml/BeanDefinitionParser.html#parse(org.w3c.dom.Element,org.springframework.beans.factory.xml.ParserContext)\">BeanDefinitionParser</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"../../../beans/factory/xml/BeanDefinitionParser.html#parse(org.w3c.dom.Element,org.springframework.beans.factory.xml.ParserContext)\">BeanDefinitionParser</a></code></span>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"../../../beans/factory/xml/BeanDefinitionParser.html#parse(org.w3c.dom.Element,org.springframework.beans.factory.xml.ParserContext)\">parse</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"../../../beans/factory/xml/BeanDefinitionParser.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.xml\">BeanDefinitionParser</a></code>",
      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"../../../beans/factory/xml/BeanDefinitionParser.html#parse(org.w3c.dom.Element,org.springframework.beans.factory.xml.ParserContext)\">parse</a></code>` 接口 `<code><a href=\"../../../beans/factory/xml/BeanDefinitionParser.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.xml\">BeanDefinitionParser</a></code>` 中",
      "count": 1
